          "paragraph_id": "c-jinshu-055-pan-yue:p014",
          "quote": "岳性輕躁，趨世利，與石崇等諂事賈謐，每候其出，與崇輒望塵而拜。構湣懷之文，岳之辭也。謐二十四友，岳為其首。謐《晉書》限斷，亦岳之辭也。其母數誚之曰：「爾當知足，而幹沒不已乎？」而岳終不能改。",
          "subject_person_mention_id": "c-jinshu-055-pan-yue:p014:m0000",
          "object_person_mention_id": "c-jinshu-055-pan-yue:p014:m0068"
        }
      ],
      "status": "source_attested",
      "interpretation_note": "本傳親稱具在，母名不詳。",
      "reviewer": "Codex（AI代理）",
      "model": null,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "a-jin055-volume-shi-brother",
      "subject_person_id": "d2b_1d3_333",
      "object_person_id": "2k5_8k3_74m",
      "predicate": "brother",
